#: Helpers.md:1
msgid "The CUDAHELPERS library"
msgstr "CUDAHELPERS ライブラリ"

#: Helpers.md:3
msgid ""
"This helper library contains an implementation of the reduction algorithm "
"using the [cub](https://nvidia.github.io/cccl/cub/) building blocks and the "
"interface between the [thrust](https://nvidia.github.io/cccl/thrust/) "
"vectors and the PLMD::Vector and PLMD::Tensor classes."
msgstr ""
"[cub](https://nvidia.github.io/cccl/cub/) による Reduction "
"と、[thrust](https://nvidia.github.io/cccl/thrust/) Vector と "
"PLMD::Vector・PLMD::Tensor の Interface を含みます。"

#: Helpers.md:8
msgid "The helper library is a header-only library `cudaHelpers.cuh`."
msgstr "Header-only の `cudaHelpers.cuh` です。"

#: Helpers.md:10
msgid ""
"See the [coordination implementation](Implementation.md) for an example of "
"how to use the code described here."
msgstr "使用例は [Coordination の実装](Implementation.md) を参照してください。"

#: Helpers.md:12
msgid "The reduction interface"
msgstr "Reduction Interface"

#: Helpers.md:14
msgid ""
"The original version used a plain CUDA C++ reduction and was implemented "
"following [this "
"guide](https://developer.download.nvidia.com/assets/cuda/files/reduction.pdf)."
" I recommend trying to implement the reduction algorithm by hand before "
"using cub, to have a better picture of the concept and of the algorithm."
msgstr ""
"初期版は "
"[この資料](https://developer.download.nvidia.com/assets/cuda/files/reduction.pdf)"
" に従う通常の CUDA C++ Reduction でした。概念とアルゴリズムを理解するため、cub を使う前に手動実装を試すことを推奨します。"

#: Helpers.md:19
msgid ""
"The call to the reduction kernels is mediated by templated interface "
"functions."
msgstr "Template Interface 関数が Reduction Kernel の呼び出しを仲介します。"

#: Helpers.md:44
msgid ""
"These interfaces ask for a `T*` instead of a `thrust::device_vector<T>` for "
"flexibility, remember to pass a device pointer, not a CPU pointer."
msgstr ""
"柔軟性のため `thrust::device_vector<T>` ではなく `T*` を取ります。CPU Pointer ではなく Device "
"Pointer を渡してください。"

#: Helpers.md:47
msgid ""
"The `dim3` type is a triplet of integers defined in the cuda headers. Here "
"we declare it as a couple of numbers to spawn a 2D (in this case) grid of "
"kernels: the first number is the number of groups that will be used, in case"
" there are more data than threads available this will be >1 and then the "
"reduction will need to be applied on the result of the calculation. The "
"second number is the number of data arrays that we are processing together, "
"for example, the virial is saved in a format of 9 blocks of consecutive "
"numbers and in that case we will use `dim3{N,9}`. In the case of a single "
"array, the 1D version will enqueue a specialized 1D kernel"
msgstr ""
"`dim3` は CUDA Header の整数3つ組です。ここでは2つの数値で2次元 Kernel Grid を作ります。第1値は Group "
"数で、Thread よりデータが多いと1超となり、結果に再 Reduction が必要です。第2値は同時処理する Array 数です。例えば "
"Virial は連続値の9 Block なので `dim3{N,9}` を使います。単一 Array の1次元版は専用 Kernel を Queue "
"に入れます。"

#: Helpers.md:57
msgid ""
"These functions should be called in a driver that loops on them, for "
"example:"
msgstr "例えば次のように、Loop する Driver から呼びます。"

#: Helpers.md:88
msgid ""
"this driver 'throws away' the input data (on the GPU) at each iteration, "
"using the containing array as a container for the output of the next "
"iteration, and using the output."
msgstr "各反復で GPU の入力データを捨て、その Array を次の出力容器に再利用します。"

#: Helpers.md:93
msgid ""
"These interfaces can be called without the stream and the kernels will be "
"serially executed."
msgstr "Stream なしでも呼べ、その場合 Kernel は逐次実行されます。"

#: Helpers.md:96
msgid "The reduction kernel"
msgstr "Reduction Kernel"

#: Helpers.md:98
msgid ""
"Here I am showing only the ND kernel, the 1D one is like this one, but with "
"the `blockIdx.y * something` parts removed."
msgstr "ここでは ND Kernel のみ示します。1次元版は `blockIdx.y * something` 部分を除いたものです。"

#: Helpers.md:101
msgid "The reduction kernels are assembled with _cub_ building blocks"
msgstr "Reduction Kernel は _cub_ の部品で構成します。"

#: Helpers.md:137
msgid ""
"The last two arguments of `cub::LoadDirectBlocked` make sure that we are "
"calling the overload that assigns 0 to data when we are trying to load out-"
"of-bound elements. We need to use this because we usually do not have powers"
" of 2 data elements to be reduced."
msgstr ""
"`cub::LoadDirectBlocked` の最後の2引数で、範囲外要素を0にする Overload "
"を選びます。通常データ数が2の冪ではないため必要です。"

#: Helpers.md:141
msgid "The PLMD-thrust interface"
msgstr "PLMD-thrust Interface"

#: Helpers.md:143
msgid ""
"_cudaHelpers.cuh_ contains an interface between `thrust`, `cuda` and the "
"`Tensor` and `Vector` class from `PLMD`."
msgstr ""
"_cudaHelpers.cuh_ は `thrust`、`cuda` と、`PLMD` の `Tensor`・`Vector` の Interface"
" を含みます。"

#: Helpers.md:146
msgid ""
"Both the `DataFrom` and the `DataTo` have an async and a non-async overload,"
" depending on the presence of the `stream` variable on call."
msgstr "`DataFrom` と `DataTo` は、呼び出し時の `stream` の有無で非同期・同期の Overload を選びます。"

#: Helpers.md:161
msgid ""
"`PLMD` data types store double precision numbers, when these functions are "
"called with a `thrust::device_vector<float>` as argument, they create a "
"temporary `std::vector` to convert and pass the data from/to the GPU. In "
"this case, the `DataFrom` function ignores the stream parameter to avoid "
"starting to convert an array that has not been completely transferred from "
"the GPU"
msgstr ""
"`PLMD` は倍精度を格納します。引数が `thrust::device_vector<float>` の場合、一時的な `std::vector` "
"で変換して GPU と転送します。この場合 `DataFrom` は Stream を無視し、転送未完了の Array の変換を防ぎます。"

#: Helpers.md:167
msgid "In the [advanced](Advanced.md) section we will use"
msgstr "[高度な実装](Advanced.md) では次を使います。"

#: Helpers.md:174
msgid ""
"That works exactly as the previous signatures, but transfers a the data from"
" a View to the GPU, there is no `From` version, since this is used to move "
"the neighbour configuration, that it is read only."
msgstr ""
"前の Signature と同じですが、View から GPU に転送します。読み取り専用の Neighbor Configuration 用なので "
"`From` 版はありません。"
